---
const github = "https://github.com/andresCamp/spectr";
---

<section class="faq">
  <div class="wrap faq-wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title">Questions</h2>

    <details>
      <summary>How does the trial work?</summary>
      <p>
        Download Spectr and use everything, free, for 48 hours. No account, no credit card.
        When the trial ends, you can purchase to keep going.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>Is it really a one-time purchase?</summary>
      <p>
        Yes. $14.99 buys the app, and updates are included. No subscription, no upsell tiers.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>Why is it paid if it's open source?</summary>
      <p>
        The <a href={github}>source is on GitHub</a>, and you're welcome to build it yourself.
        The $14.99 buys the built, signed, notarized app with updates, and it funds the work.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>Where do my documents live?</summary>
      <p>
        On your disk, as plain .md files. Spectr has no database and no sync service.
        It opens the file, renders it beautifully, and writes your edits back.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>What does it require?</summary>
      <p>macOS 14 or later, on Apple Silicon or Intel.</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq {
    padding: 96px 0 120px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--divider-color);
  }

  .faq-wrap {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  details {
    margin-top: 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider-color);
    padding-bottom: 20px;
  }

  summary {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 590;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    transition: color 150ms ease;
  }

  summary:hover {
    color: var(--trim-color);
  }

  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  summary::after {
    content: "+";
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    transition: transform 200ms ease;
  }

  details[open] summary::after {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  details p {
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    max-width: 58ch;
  }
</style>
